      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIDNIGHT MIRAGE (2) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished third and beaten 8 lengths (25.68) at this track in Grade 5. Overdue and gets her chance. MAJESTIC JOJO (4) turned in a plain effort last time when seventh at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Calla Naughty (17.95) in a Free For All. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Cannot be underestimated. CYCLONE SKYLAH (5) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 0.8 lengths (16.73) behind Hope I Can at Casino. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. ROBELL SETH (8) can play a role coming off a short let-up.",
